tion":"Anything directly related to the `_snapshot/*` APIs"},{"id":912828538,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5MTI4Mjg1Mzg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/:Data%20Management/ILM+SLM","name":":Data Management/ILM+SLM","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":"DO NOT USE. Use \":StorageEngine/ILM\" or \":Distributed Coordination/SLM\" instead."},{"id":1967496097,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NDk2MDk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Data%20Management%20(obsolete)","name":"Team:Data Management (obsolete)","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"DO NOT USE. This team no longer exists."},{"id":1967496670,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NDk2Njcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Distributed","name":"Team:Distributed","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Meta label for distributed team."},{"id":1967497573,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NDk3NTcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Docs","name":"Team:Docs","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Meta label for docs team"},{"id":2042400575,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDQyNDAwNTc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/needs:triage","name":"needs:triage","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"Requires assignment of a team area label"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2022-03-29T02:43:36Z","updated_at":"2022-03-29T15:02:26Z","closed_at":"2022-03-29T15:02:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Elasticsearch Version\r\n\r\n8.x\r\n\r\n### Installed Plugins\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Java Version\r\n\r\n_bundled_\r\n\r\n### OS Version\r\n\r\nsupported major OS\r\n\r\n### Problem Description\r\n\r\nIn manual, there's such description\r\nhttps://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/8.1/searchable-snapshots.html\r\n\r\n> Indices managed by ILM are prefixed with `recovered-` when fully mounted.\r\n\r\nScreenshot:\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"600\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/30574753/160521435-be0e0193-79b6-46e0-b30c-b8ebeb7bd784.png\">\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nHowever, when testing the behavior, it's actually not using the prefix `recovered-`, but instead, it's using `restored-`.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"700\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/30574753/160521823-d7c4b4af-29fb-4ffd-abdb-5fab4dbe3310.png\">\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe prefix `restored-` is the same as 7.x, which is mentioned below.\r\nhttps://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/7.17/ilm-searchable-snapshot.html\r\n\r\nAlso additionally, the following page 8.x version also shows the correct spelling.\r\nhttps://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/8.1/ilm-searchable-snapshot.html\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBased on that, seemingly it's a simple typo when that line was added into the manual and it caused the confusion.\r\nhttps://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/8.1/searchable-snapshots.html#searchable-snapshot-mount-storage-options\r\n\r\n### Steps to Reproduce\r\n\r\nas mentioned above.\r\n\r\nCan we have someone double check if this is a simple doc typo please?\r\nI am happy to file a doc fix PR but want to check about the tech part at first.\r\n\r\n### Logs (if relevant)\r\n\r\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"elasticsearchmachine","id":58790826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkwODI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58790826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine","html_url":"https://github.com/elasticsearchmachine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/85432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/85432/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}